    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Hola! ¿Has visto a mis Floette?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 200,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10048006F006C00610021002000BF00480061007300200076006900730074006F002000610020006D0069007300200046006C006F0065007400740065003F00100002011401740000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Conseguí hacerme con Flabébé de los cinco\ncolores y, mira, ¡han evolucionado!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 276,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 82
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Flo, flooo!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 440,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10046006C006F002C00200066006C006F006F006F00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Sabes qué es lo que más me gustaría ahora?\nVer a estas cinco monadas luchar a la vez.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 468,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 91
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Necesito algo que me inspire a crear nuevos\ntintes de pelo!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 652,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004E006500630065007300690074006F00200061006C0067006F00200071007500650020006D006500200069006E00730070006900720065002000610020006300720065006100720020006E007500650076006F0073000A00740069006E007400650073002000640065002000700065006C006F002100100002011401740000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 65
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Podrías ayudarme?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nSolo te pido que luches contra mis cinco Floette\nal mismo tiempo.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 784,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 92
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Si te animas, ya sabes dónde encontrarme.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 968,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0053006900200074006500200061006E0069006D00610073002C0020007900610020007300610062006500730020006400F3006E0064006500200065006E0063006F006E0074007200610072006D0065002E00100002011401740000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1060,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Te animas a enfrentarte a mis cinco Floette\nal mismo tiempo?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1072,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF0054006500200061006E0069006D006100730020006100200065006E006600720065006E00740061007200740065002000610020006D00690073002000630069006E0063006F00200046006C006F0065007400740065000A0061006C0020006D00690073006D006F0020007400690065006D0070006F003F00100002011401740000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 66
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Por supuesto!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1204,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10050006F007200200073007500700075006500730074006F00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Me gustaría prepararme antes",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1236,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D0065002000670075007300740061007200ED0061002000700072006500700061007200610072006D006500200061006E0074006500730000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Claro, no te preocupes. ¡Enfrentarse a cinco\noponentes al mismo tiempo no es tarea fácil!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1296,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 94
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Vamos, hermosuras! ¡Que fluyan los colores\nen el campo de batalla!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1484,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100560061006D006F0073002C0020006800650072006D006F007300750072006100730021002000A100510075006500200066006C007500790061006E0020006C006F007300200063006F006C006F007200650073000A0065006E00200065006C002000630061006D0070006F00200064006500200062006100740061006C006C0061002100100002011401740000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1628,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ha sido tan emocionante...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1640,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004800610020007300690064006F002000740061006E00200065006D006F00630069006F006E0061006E00740065002E002E002E00100002011401740000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "En el tumulto del combate, los cinco colores de\nsus flores se han entremezclado y es como si<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nhubiese surgido un color completamente nuevo...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n¡Tengo que ponerme manos a la obra!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1704,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 187
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Si a los colores les añades blanco,\nconsigues un tono pastel la mar de precioso!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2080,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Ahora puedes elegir de entre nueve nuevos tintes\npastel en la peluquería!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2252,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 75
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Puedes estar orgullos<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoa. Gracias a ti, la gente de\nCiudad Luminalia podrá disfrutar de tintes de pelo<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nmucho más coloridos ahora.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2404,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 141
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Siempre serás bienvenid<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoa en mi peluquería\ncuando te apetezca un cambio de estilo.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŴ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2688,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
